alse,"text":"what a time to be alive","url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2026566854832173258","conversationId":"2026560557365735520","inReplyToId":"2026566825161765021","inReplyToUsername":"poteto","quotedPost":null,"media":[],"externalUrl":"","likeCount":2,"replyCount":0,"retweetCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"viewCount":569,"bookmarkCount":0,"language":"en","possiblySensitive":false},{"id":"2026566825161765021","createdAt":"2026-02-25T07:55:57+00:00","author":"poteto","displayName":"lauren","profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2093473719830315008/oo09g1Ov_normal.jpg","type":"reply","isQuote":false,"text":"so a next evolution of the paradigm might be something like BCI. why express intent through lossy language when you can communicate raw thoughts as pure data","url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2026566825161765021","conversationId":"2026560557365735520","inReplyToId":"2026566101497413771","inReplyToUsername":"poteto","quotedPost":null,"media":[],"externalUrl":"","likeCount":2,"replyCount":1,"retweetCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"viewCount":611,"bookmarkCount":0,"language":"en","possiblySensitive":false},{"id":"2026566101497413771","createdAt":"2026-02-25T07:53:05+00:00","author":"poteto","displayName":"lauren","profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2093473719830315008/oo09g1Ov_normal.jpg","type":"reply","isQuote":false,"text":"just some random thoughts as i have been thinking about what a type system for markdown would look like. but maybe that's fundamentally misunderstanding what we're gaining. the ambiguity _is_ the feature. maybe a type system would not meaningfully add anything","url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2026566101497413771","conversationId":"2026560557365735520","inReplyToId":"2026565565054140803","inReplyToUsername":"poteto","quotedPost":null,"media":[],"externalUrl":"","likeCount":2,"replyCount":1,"retweetCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"viewCount":177,"bookmarkCount":0,"language":"en","possiblySensitive":false},{"id":"20265647465652